 "note": "Candy Cow, Shop 3 on the corner of Bottrill St and Bussell Hwy, Cowaramup: the fudge and sweets shop in the timber shop complex on the east side of Bottrill St, just off the highway, with MuKau Giftware & Gallery (Shop 2) in its north end. From the Landgate aerial (Oct 2026) and 2019 street photos from Bussell Hwy (Mapillary, reference only). The north end (MuKau): brown weatherboard with a steep gable to the Bottrill St junction and the highway, white rendered shopfront under a grey skillion verandah. Candy Cow: cream walls under a long low grey gable, a verandah along Bottrill St, then a small hipped south block. A wing with solar panels behind (outbuilding). A cow and a calf statue on its verandah (the town's herd). Name in plain lettering, no logo or mural. Metres: x left to right as seen from Bottrill St (north to south), y back (east) from the verandah line.",
